      "content": "That's a good start. Could you expand a bit on the specific types of \"friction\" or \"clashes\" you're seeing in the literature? Like, when people talk about the loss of neighborhood character in these contexts, are there specific patterns regarding things like property values, crime rates, or even just the general sense of safety and order that typically change when these specific demographics move in? I want to make sure the report covers the more pragmatic concerns residents often raise.",
